  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit shown below, maximum Zener diode current will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mA</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8442604a-603c-487b-8d83-64ed57722a78-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 126px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3842b7f0-258b-4c55-87b8-6a30988fe1aa-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 143px;\" /><b>​​​​​​​</b></p><p>Current through load resistor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&Omega;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>006</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and current through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&Omega;</mi></math>&nbsp;resistor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&Omega;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>015</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Thus, maximum current through Zener diode is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>Z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>015</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>006</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>009</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
